{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1472343-on-supernal-abilities-and-charm-upgrades","id":1472343,"title":"On Supernal abilities and Charm Upgrades","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-01-12T19:43:12-08:00","id":1472343,"title":"On Supernal abilities and Charm Upgrades","content":"So, as far as Supernal abilities are concerned, the character's Essence is 5 for the purpose of buying and upgrading Charms, but how does one define 'upgrading'? Is it just for cases such as &quot;an Essence 2 repurchase of this Charm allows such-and-such&quot;, or does it also include &quot;at Essence 3, this Charm can instead...&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/665-shkspr1048","name":"shkspr1048","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"630"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-13T09:18:04-08:00","id":1472365,"title":"","content":"If a Charm requires a repurchase to gain a new power at a higher essence, you still have to repurchase it, but you can ignore the Essence prerequisite. If it gains a new power automatically at a higher essence, you have the upgrade automatically with your Supernal Ability Charms.<br /> <br /> The exception is if a Charm uses your Essence rating as a modifier of some kind (i.e. multiply by Essence, a range of Essence miles, that sort of thing). In those cases you still have to use your actual Essence in your Supernal Ability.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}